"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllCheckboxComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide all tokens to the users."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CheckboxComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"checkboxes","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Checkboxes","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of sizes (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SizeSemanticToken"},{"type":"text","text":") and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"borders ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BorderRadiusSemanticToken"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BorderWidthSemanticToken"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These components share the same type of tokens which are all gathered here."}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BlueCoatThemeCheckboxComponentTokensProvider"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"BlueCoatThemeCheckboxComponentTokensProvider"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/misothemesmisobluecoat\/bluecoatthemecheckboxcomponenttokensprovider","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat\/documentation\/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat\/BlueCoatThemeCheckboxComponentTokensProvi